[0.680761, "o", "\r\n── S6 improve — scripted mock-LLM candidate wins; gate promotes\r\n   look at: gate verdict, baseline vs candidate scores, skill-store versions + provenance\r\n"]
[0.723445, "o", "\r\n── Promote cycle finished (RUN-PROMOTE-CYCLE)\r\n   verdict: :PROMOTE\r\n   cycle-id: \"demo-promote\"\r\n   baseline-score (old: prefix → 0): 0\r\n   candidate-score (echo: prefix → 1): 1\r\n   eval-run-id: \"demo-promote/eval\"\r\n\r\n── Skill store after promotion\r\n   look at: a new version of skill \"parity-improve\" with cycle/eval provenance\r\n   version count: 1\r\n   version id: \"1\"\r\n   version name: \"parity-improve\"\r\n   provenance: (:CYCLE-ID \"demo-promote\" :EVAL-RUN-ID \"demo-promote/eval\"\r\n                :BASELINE-SCORE 0 :CANDIDATE-SCORE 1 :VERDICT :PROMOTE)\r\n"]
[0.723788, "o", "\r\n── Second pass — critical case regresses: gate must DEMOTE despite a higher mean\r\n   look at: verdict :DEMOTE while candidate-score > baseline-score\r\n"]
[0.725125, "o", "   verdict: :DEMOTE\r\n"]
[0.725155, "o", "   baseline-score: 1/3\r\n   candidate-score: 2/3\r\n   candidate > baseline: T\r\n\r\n── S6 done. Reviewer: first cycle :PROMOTE + skill version; second :DEMOTE on :critical.\r\n"]
